+/*
+ * Seasonal Favorites renderer for The Daily Grind homepage.
+ *
+ * Cards are authored as HTML strings and rendered dynamically. Every write to
+ * an HTML sink goes through a Trusted Types policy backed by DOMPurify, and
+ * the page CSP (`require-trusted-types-for 'script'`) makes the browser
+ * reject any raw-string assignment to innerHTML / outerHTML /
+ * insertAdjacentHTML / document.write etc. that bypasses these policies.
+ */
